\pard\tx3600\tx3980\tx4340\fs28\li1500\fc0\cf0 Returns the rectangle in which the knob will be drawn, specified in the coordinate system of the NSSlider or NSMatrix with which the NSSliderCell is associated. 
\i flipped
\i0  indicates whether that coordinate system is flipped, a question you can answer by sending NSView's 
